  "pages": [
    {
      "page_id": "p01",
      "text": "Look around. The sky is blue and the sea is blue, but up close, blue is hard to find.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_071/pages/p01.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/pages/p01.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8411,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/song/p01.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9900
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p02",
      "text": "No animal with fur is blue. Not a panda, not a zebra, not a fox.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_071/pages/p02.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/pages/p02.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7993,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/song/p02.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 6922
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p03",
      "text": "A blue jay is not blue. Crush the wing and the blue runs away: the dust is brown.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_071/pages/p03.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/pages/p03.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8463,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/song/p03.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8646
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "That blue is a trick of light. Tiny bumps in the wing toss the blue around at you.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_071/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6399,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9064
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "The sky runs the same trick. Sunlight hits it, and the blue bounces across the sky again and again.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_071/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8463,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9639
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "Blue food is hard to find: no blue banana, no blue bean, no blue nut. That blue soda came from a lab.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_071/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 10213,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 11728
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "Long ago, people had no word for blue. To them the sea was dark.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_071/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6870,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7157
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Blue jeans get blue from a plant. It took a heap of plants to fill a pot.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_071/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6034,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7392
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "A blue sofa, a blue umbrella, a blue truck \u2014 that blue is not alive. It came from a pot.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_071/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 9247,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10475
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p10",
      "text": "So go on a blue hunt. Blue is all around you, and almost all of it is a trick.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_071/pages/p10.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_071/audio/pages/p10.mp3",
